<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>RORO - Dart 2 - (built 1984) 4,700 dwt sold to Uk buyers for $3.8 million.</p>
<p>SOLD FOR DEMOLITION - Bai Yun Hai - (built 1967) 20,030 dwt sold within China for $147 per ldt.</p>
<p>Frycz-Modrzewski - (built 1968) 14,605 dwt sold for $163 per ldt.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to inspection, survey or other conditions.</p>
